        "created_at": "2013-09-02T18:54:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>New to the game.&nbsp; I've played a couple of games and a couple different characters adn I LOVE the game.&nbsp; One thing I cannot fathom however; I've pored over the cards and I cannot for the life of me figure out how to use Absolute Zero effectively.&nbsp; Nearest I can figure is purposely doing Fire damage to yourself (or having Ra do it), to deal out Cold.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm obviously missing something here, so I have to ask; How do I use Absolute Zero effectively?</p>",
