        "created_at": "2013-09-03T03:16:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Envisioner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Envisioner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>PlatinumWarlock wrote:</b><br><blockquote>And, if you find you're having trouble, try out the Absolute Zero: Elemental Wrath variant. &nbsp;It (and many other variants from the assorted Kickstarters) are available to print on BoardGameGeek (with &gt;G's permission!).\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nNeat as that is, I don't have a printer.&nbsp; Can they somehow be purchased from &gt;G?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The promo cards can not be purchased from &gt;G. They have been given out at conventions and part of Kickstarters.</p>\n<p>You could probably take a file to a local print shop if you want to get it printed. Perhaps laminate it as long as you're there.</p>",
