        "raw": "[quote=\"Envisioner\"]\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>PlatinumWarlock wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">And, if you find you&#39;re having trouble, try out the Absolute Zero: Elemental Wrath variant. &nbsp;It (and many other variants from the assorted Kickstarters) are available to print on BoardGameGeek (with &gt;G&#39;s permission!).\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nNeat as that is, I don&#39;t have a printer.&nbsp; Can they somehow be purchased from &gt;G?\n\n[/quote]\n\nThe promo cards can not be purchased from &gt;G. They have been given out at conventions and part of Kickstarters.\n\nYou could probably take a file to a local print shop if you want to get it printed. Perhaps laminate it as long as you&#39;re there.\n",
